  - Term: "ui\x2fenhancement\x2fairCombo1Lv0Desc"
    TermType: 0
    Description: 
    Languages:
    - "Smash the enemy with the flat side of the blade, bouncing them off
    the ground and back into the air."
    - "\u4F7F\u7528\u9524\u51FB\u5C06\u654C\u4EBA\u62CD\u5230\u5730\u9762\u5E76\u5F39\u8D77"
    - "\u4F7F\u7528\u9318\u64CA\u5C07\u6575\u4EBA\u62CD\u5230\u5730\u9762\u4E26\u5F48\u8D77"
    - "\u6253\u6483\u653B\u6483\u3067\u6575\u3092\u5730\u9762\u306B\u53E9\u304D\u8FBC\u3093\u3067\u8DF3\u306D\u8FD4\u3059"
    - "Frappe l'ennemi avec le plat de la lame, l'envoyant dans les airs."
    - "Golpea al enemigo con la parte plana de la espada, haciendo rebotar
    al enemigo en el suelo y mand\u00E1ndolo de nuevo hacia arriba."
