    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    Flags: 000000000000
  - Term: "subtitle\x2fe1t14"
    TermType: 0
    Description: 
    Languages:
    - "The Black Star always rises."
    - "\u613F\u9ED1\u661F\u7167\u5E38\u5347\u8D77"
    - "\u9858\u9ED1\u661F\u7167\u5E38\u5347\u8D77"
    - "\u9ED2\u3044\u661F\u304C\u3044\u3064\u3082\u3069\u304A\u308A\u6607\u308B"
    - "L'\u00C9toile Noire finit toujours par se r\u00E9veiller."
    - "La estrella negra siempre emerge."
